9. Provide comprehensive documentation, including setup instructions, configuration options, and examples of usage.

10. Integrate automated testing frameworks to validate the correctness and performance of the logging framework under various scenarios, including stress tests and edge cases.

This design provides a modular, scalable logging framework that can be easily integrated into an existing microservices architecture while minimizing impact on service latency and resource usage. With this foundation in place, you can continue optimizing the framework for performance and security as needed.']

