3. Error Handling:
- Implement retry logic for transient failures with exponential backoff and jitter using Boost.Asio's deadline timers.
- Provide detailed metrics for failed operations and ensure graceful recovery.

```cpp
#include <boost/asio/deadline_timer.hpp>

void retry(function<void()>& func, unsigned int maxRetries) {
    auto backoff = chrono::milliseconds(100);
    auto jitter = chrono::milliseconds(rand() % 50 + 50);

    for (unsigned int i = 0; i < maxRetries; ++i) {
        try {
            func();
            return;
        } catch (const system_error& e) {
            if (e.code() != errno::try_again)
                throw e;

            this_thread::sleep_for(backoff + jitter);
            backoff *= 2;
            jitter = chrono::milliseconds(rand() % 50 + 50);
        }
    }
}
```

